SUITE: Reqres sample APIs
DESC: Test your front-end against a real API
OPTIONS: {"STOP-ON-FAILURE": false}

URL: https://reqres.in

TEST: List Users
DESC: This test case return the list of users
TAG: setup
  REQUEST: GET /api/users?page=2
  EXPECT: STATUS 200

TEST: Single User
DESC: This test case return a single user
TAG: setup
  REQUEST: GET /api/users/2
  EXPECT: STATUS 200
  EXPECT: CONTAINS data
